config BR2_PACKAGE_ESOS_K3
    bool "esos-k3"
    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_SYSTEM_TARGET_K3
    help
        SpacemiT ESOS (Energy Service OS) firmware for the K3 RT24
        real-time coprocessor cores. Produces esos.itb for the boot
        image. Not required to boot Linux on the X100 application cores;
        brings up the RT cores (power-mgmt offload, audio DSP).
